  "title": "Linde Announces Second Quarter 2026 Earnings and Conference Call Schedule",
  "summary": "Woking, UK, July 1, 2026 – Linde (Nasdaq: LIN) will release its second quarter 2026 financial results by 06:00 EDT/midday CEST on Friday, July 31, 2026. The Company will host and webcast its conference call at 09:00 EDT/15:00 CEST, which will be available to the public and the media in listen-only mode.",
